{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18106200","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18106200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1810620001:0":{"text":"드디어... 테페시아 아가씨의 계승 의식을 치르게 됐어!","source_cn":"终于……终于要为苔佩希小姐举行继任仪式了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DD450392B2C1449","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810620002:0":{"text":"아, 이제는 테페시아 님이라고 불러야지.","source_cn":"不，不对。现在该称苔佩希阁下了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA39F4FEE9908E3C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810620003:0":{"text":"왜 그렇게 들떠 있어? 계승을 하든 말든 우리 같은 하인에게는 별 차이 없잖아. 어차피 테페시아 님은 이곳의 주인이신데.","source_cn":"你为什么这么兴奋？对于你我这样的仆人而言，无论她是否继...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5DD728B7C6F3BCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810620004:1":{"text":"하지만 계승 의식 뒤에는 무도회가 있잖아! 성대한 무도회! 성이 수십 년, 아니... 수백 년 만에 떠들썩해진다고!","source_cn":"可是继任仪式之后有舞会啊，盛大的舞会！城堡里几十年，甚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4467FCA5047F5F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810620005:1":{"text":"마침 이번 무도회에서 난 시중을 들도록 배정되지 않았으니까, 나도 어디 구석에 가서 무도회 분위기를 좀 즐겨볼 거야. 어디가 적당하려나...","source_cn":"刚好这次舞会没有安排我去服侍，也许我也该找个角落享受一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CC4E79585ED197E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810620006:1":{"text":"무도회 분위기를 즐기려면... 당연히 홀 중앙이지.","source_cn":"享受舞会的氛围啊……那肯定要待在大厅附近。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C6534C873AC4C6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810620007:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">홀 중앙의 뱀파이어 박쥐 샹들리에 위</style>는 어때? <style=\"highlight\">장치를 조작해서 박쥐 날개를 펼치기만 하면</style> 계단 양쪽에서 올라갈 수 있고, 손님들에게 들키지도 않을 거야.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>大厅中央那盏血蝠吊灯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E10CDB8C2AE6D04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810620008:1":{"text":"어, 그거 괜찮네... 한번 해 볼게.","source_cn":"唔，果然是个不错的主意……我会试试看的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67760B67CF1EF315","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810620009:1":{"text":"두 환영이 침묵하더니, 잠시 후 다시 처음부터 대화를 시작했다.","source_cn":"两个幻象陷入了沉默。片刻之后，对话又从头开始。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x852262DF8C45F1AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810620010:0":{"text":"저 말대로라면 홀 중앙의 샹들리에는 그 위를 걸을 수 있을 뿐만 아니라, 양쪽 계단과도 이어지는 것 같아.","source_cn":"听他们的说法，大厅中央的吊灯不仅可以行走，似乎还能连通...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A7F7BB2C3B9AAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1810620011:1":{"text":"우리도 환영이 말한 장치를 통해서 반대편으로 갈 수 있을지도 모르겠군요.","source_cn":"或许我们也能通过幻象中提及的机关去到另一侧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x377C2920BE21FA77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1810620012:0":{"text":"가봅시다.","source_cn":"走吧，去看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DDE3E94DFAE9354","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:激动的女仆幻象":{"text":"격앙된 메이드의 환영","source":"激动的女仆幻象","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:镇定的男仆幻象":{"text":"침착한 하인의 환영","source":"镇定的男仆幻象","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"나레이션","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:爱丝特瑞达":{"text":"에스트릴다","source":"爱丝特瑞达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瑟恩":{"text":"세인","source":"瑟恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":5}}